# Implementation

Server-first. `action/<segment>/` mirrors routes — one mutation → `auth.api` (auth) or `createRouterClient` (product) → `updateTag` when needed.

Suspense only on request-API slices (`headers`, `cookies`) and URL data (`params`, `searchParams`). Auth gates in `dashboard-session.ts` (`requireDashboardSession`, `requirePlatformAdmin`, `requireOrganizationManager`) — call them in the page and its `get-*.ts`, not only the layout. No pre-check before `auth.api` in actions.

Next.js: inspect `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` under `apps/web` before coding — never web-search ([nextjs.md](docs/agents/nextjs.md)).

Storage uploads: named route → `toOwnedPublicUrl` → `auth.api` → `deleteRouteObjects` → cache invalidation — [implementation.md § Storage](docs/agents/implementation.md#storage-uploads).

